      "claim": "D(x^(2/3)*(5-x)) == (10-5x)/(3*x^(1/3)) ;; SUB(x^(2/3)*(5-x), 2) == 3*2^(2/3) ;; SUB((x^2)^(1/3)*(5-x), -1) == 6"
    },
